OL,3,GNEWSAHeritage site call for 'last in   
OL,4,Aworld' mill                            
OL,6,FOne of the world's last remaining      
OL,7,Ftraditional textile mills should become
OL,8,Fa world heritage site, a historian has 
OL,9,Fsaid.                                  
OL,11,FRoger Frost, former mayor of Burnley,  
OL,12,Fwho now heads the Burnley Civic        
OL,13,FSociety, said Queen Street Mill in     
OL,14,FBriercliffe, represented "the          
OL,15,Fingenuity" of Lancastrians of this now 
OL,16,Fbygone industry.                       
OL,18,FBuilt in 1894, Queen Street Mill       
OL,19,Fremains the last steam-powered cotton  
OL,20,Fweaving mill in the world and in its   
OL,21,Fheyday, about 620 workers depended on  
OL,22,Fit in Burnley.                         
