OL,3,GNEWSAHeritage site call for 'last in   
OL,4,Aworld' mill                            
OL,6,FThe mill, which helped Britain power   
OL,7,Fits way through the Industrial         
OL,8,FRevolution, closed in 1982 and has     
OL,9,Fsince become a popular museum          
OL,10,Fattraction.                            
